M Oscillator (Harm)","Parameters"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-573","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM/Noise",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)","Parameters"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-671","Source",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-684","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/16 HARM",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)","Source"]],["p-11db650f1656b19c.html","source-block-117","Noise (Harm)",[]],["p-11db650f1656b19c.html","source-block-134","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM.",["Noise (Harm)"]],["p-11db650f1656b19c.html","source-block-263","Sets the amount of phase-modulated noise and the master clip level.",["Noise (Harm)"]],["p-11db650f1656b19c.html","source-block-334","Source",["Noise (Harm)"]],["p-11db650f1656b19c.html","source-block-347","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/16 HARM",["Noise (Harm)","Source"]],["p-9b568a3b64f706b0.html","source-block-117","Rectification (Harm)",[]],["p-9b568a3b64f706b0.html","source-block-142","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM.",["Rectification (Harm)"]],["p-9b568a3b64f706b0.html","source-block-272","Adjusts rectification of the individual partials, similar to a half fold.",["Rectification (Harm)"]],["p-9b568a3b64f706b0.html","source-block-349","Source",["Rectification (Harm)"]],["p-9b568a3b64f706b0.html","source-block-362","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/16 HARM",["Rectification (Harm)","Source"]],["p-b262eefaa14d9d39.html","source-block-117","Spread (Harm)",[]],["p-b262eefaa14d9d39.html","source-block-135","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM.",["Spread (Harm)"]],["p-b262eefaa14d9d39.html","source-block-263","Sets the relation between partials. At zero they are in unison; at maximum they are an octave apart. Intermediate positions interpolate linearly in frequency.",["Spread (Harm)"]],["p-b262eefaa14d9d39.html","source-block-425","Source",["Spread (Harm)"]],["p-b262eefaa14d9d39.html","source-block-438","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/16 HARM",["Spread (Harm)","Source"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-225","Harmonic OSC (Harmo)",[]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-250","Oscillator model 4 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Harmo.",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-356","Parameters",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-373","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo/Content",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)","Parameters"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-473","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo/Sculpting",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)","Parameters"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-577","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo/Chorus",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)","Parameters"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-677","Source",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)"]],["p-e0812e42e14c03d2.html","source-block-690","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/04 Harmo",["Harmonic OSC (Harmo)","Source"]],["p-af7e98d08a573a8d.html","source-block-118","Chorus (Harmo)",[]],["p-af7e98d08a573a8d.html","source-block-137","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo.",["Chorus (Harmo)"]],["p-af7e98d08a573a8d.html","source-block-267","Adds chorus to the oscillator sound, making it wider.",["Chorus (Harmo)"]],["p-af7e98d08a573a8d.html","source-block-324","Source",["Chorus (Harmo)"]],["p-af7e98d08a573a8d.html","source-block-337","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/04 Harmo",["Chorus (Harmo)","Source"]],["p-d2f2adb88cbb1370.html","source-block-118","Content (Harmo)",[]],["p-d2f2adb88cbb1370.html","source-block-138","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo.",["Content (Harmo)"]],["p-d2f2adb88cbb1370.html","source-block-267","The Wave knob morphs through different tables of harmonic amplitudes and switches between them. Higher values provide tones with richer harmonic content.",["Content (Harmo)"]],["p-d2f2adb88cbb1370.html","source-block-424","Source",["Content (Harmo)"]],["p-d2f2adb88cbb1370.html","source-block-437","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/04 Harmo",["Content (Harmo)","Source"]],["p-476b3c9493122fc8.html","source-block-118","Sculpting (Harmo)",[]],["p-476b3c9493122fc8.html","source-block-140","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Harmo.",["Sculpting (Harmo)"]],["p-476b3c9493122fc8.html","source-block-271","The Timbre knob morphs between a sine and a triangle wave. A harmonic derived from a sine wave sounds different from one built from a triangle wave.",["Sculpting (Harmo)"]],["p-476b3c9493122fc8.html","source-block-423","Source",["Sculpting (Harmo)"]],["p-476b3c9493122fc8.html","source-block-436","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/04 Harmo",["Sculpting (Harmo)","Source"]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-225","Hit grains",[]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-240","Oscillator model 21 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Hit grains.",["Hit grains"]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-352","Parameters",["Hit grains"]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-369","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Hit Grains/Start",["Hit grains","Parameters"]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-472","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Hit Grains/Density",["Hit grains","Parameters"]],["p-42e05e9de3033684.html","source-block-579","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Mic