freak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/KarplusStr.",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-281","Sets the resonator's resonance by controlling its decay.",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-341","Source",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-354","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/05 KarplusStr",["Decay (KarplusStr)","Source"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-123","Position (KarplusStr)",[]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-149","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/KarplusStr.",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-285","Controls where and how hard the resonator is struck. It does not affect the bowed part of the sound.",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-389","Source",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-402","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/05 KarplusStr",["Position (KarplusStr)","Source"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-217","Modal Resonator (Modal)",[]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-245","Oscillator model 12 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Modal.",["Modal Resonator (Modal)"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-352","Parameters",["Modal Resonator (Modal)"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-369","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Inharm",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-468","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Timbre",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-569","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Decay",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]