ml","source-block-139","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Sample.",["Length (Sample)"]],["p-5e38fa66846f52de.html","source-block-271","The Timbre knob sets sample length from -100 to 100. Negative values play the sample backward.",["Length (Sample)"]],["p-5e38fa66846f52de.html","source-block-369","Source",["Length (Sample)"]],["p-5e38fa66846f52de.html","source-block-382","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/18 Sample",["Length (Sample)","Source"]],["p-f79d3d132ecbd368.html","source-block-119","Loop (Sample)",[]],["p-f79d3d132ecbd368.html","source-block-137","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Sample.",["Loop (Sample)"]],["p-f79d3d132ecbd368.html","source-block-268","After setting Start and End with Length, Loop crossfades between those positions. At 100, only a very short part at the end of the sample loops.",["Loop (Sample)"]],["p-f79d3d132ecbd368.html","source-block-416","Source",["Loop (Sample)"]],["p-f79d3d132ecbd368.html","source-block-429","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/18 Sample",["Loop (Sample)","Source"]],["p-78ca367a7c635e22.html","source-block-119","Start (Sample)",[]],["p-78ca367a7c635e22.html","source-block-138","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Sample.",["Start (Sample)"]],["p-78ca367a7c635e22.html","source-block-268","The Wave knob sets the sample's starting point, from 0 at the beginning to 100 at the end.",["Start (Sample)"]],["p-78ca367a7c635e22.html","source-block-362","Source",["Start (Sample)"]],["p-78ca367a7c635e22.html","source-block-375","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/18 Sample",["Start (Sample)","Source"]],["p-8baf57eafaf44d94.html","source-block-214","SAWX Oscillator (Sawx)",[]],["p-8baf57eafaf44d94.html","source-block-241","Oscillator model 15 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the